You are working in Eldrin UI, a React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v4 component
library built from scratch (no ShadCN).

Every design token carries intent metadata (purpose, what it's not for,
accessibility requirements) — see `packages/eldrin-ui/src/tokens/`.

Every component is defined by a machine-readable spec before
implementation: `packages/eldrin-ui/src/components/<Name>/<NAME>.md`. Read the spec before
writing or modifying a component — the spec is upstream of both the code
and the generated Figma component, so edit the spec first and regenerate
rather than hand-editing the code or the Figma instance out of sync with it.

See CLAUDE.md and DESIGN.md for full project context.
